<title>FRANCE: French April household confidence unchanged.</title>
<headline>French April household confidence unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>INSEE gave the following data on household opinions. A positive figure shows the percentage points by which the percentage of respondents saying the things had improved or risen outnumbered the percentage saying things had worsened.</p>
<p>				     Apr   Mar   Feb  Jan Dec Nov Oct</p>
<p> Overall index		   -32   -32   -30  -30 -32 -33 -34</p>
<p> Past living standards	 -62   -65   -64  -67 -66 -69 -71</p>
<p> Future living standards     -42   -39   -36  -35 -38 -39 -39</p>
<p> Future unemployment	    65    63    51   61  56  67  71</p>
<p> Past inflation		  -52   -50   -49  -44 -52 -52 -51</p>
<p> Future inflation		-41   -40   -38  -35 -37 -34 -36</p>
<p> Good time to spend	    -24   -26   -24  -23 -25 -29 -31</p>
<p> Good time to save		47    52    52   52  50  54  54</p>
<p> Current personal finances     9    10    10   10   9   9   6</p>
<p> Past personal finances	-21   -21   -20  -20 -21 -21 -23</p>
<p> Future personal finances     -7    -8    -6   -7  -8  -8  -8</p>
<p> Ability to save		 -32   -26   -27  -28 -29 -27 -29</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5381</p>
